<title>GREECE: OTE TELECOM SHAREHOLDERS PICK NEW BOARD.</title>
<headline>OTE TELECOM SHAREHOLDERS PICK NEW BOARD.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>OTE telecoms emerged with a new board of directors following an extraordinary shareholders meeting on Tuesday where the state, its major shareholder, appointed the following board, OTE said.</p>
<p>Board chairman: Dimitris Papoulias</p>
<p>Managing Director: Petros Lambrou</p>
<p>Members: S. Avgerinos, N. Kalouptsidis, N. Papadodimas, P. Tzanikos, G. Chrysolouris, P. Tsoupidis (minority representative) and employee representatives I. Lambrakis, N. Petas and G. Orfanos.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
